/E (Anybody following me knows that I'm overseas and doing a bunch of volunteer work. Meanwhile, I still currently have a fiat job back home and am collecting deposits for the holiday season. I've got a reoccurring client that always wants to pay via CC and I never let her because of the fees. This year, I took the bait because of Square's new bitcoin conversion thingy. I didn't even have a Square account before. Long story short: it worked! She's only paid the 20% deposit, and may do the rest some other way because I still jacked the rate to cover CC fees on my end. But still!)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
