/E (So, this week I: bought my first drugs with bitcoin; got paid in bitcoin for the first time; and created my first home assistant instance that made a bitcoin miner respond to a solar inverter. I'll post about the latter next week after some more testing. Not trying to pretend everything in my world is going great right now. Plenty of things are very hard and painful. I just wanted to share in case you're sitting there not seeing bitcoin adoption in your neck of the woods. Adoption is definitely happening in other places.)
