/T (   Protecting the environment is part of living in nature, because without it, you are kind of fucked. So I was in continuous looking for dead fallen trees around the area; this happen quite often due to heavy winds and storms, high pines could fall and after few months are dried and easier to carry. A green log is much heavier than a dried log.)
